description: The Seventh Sister is a character from Star Wars Rebels, a member of the Inquisitorius, a group of dark side Force users tasked with hunting down Jedi after the rise of the Empire. Her real name is unknown, but she was trained by Darth Vader and is highly skilled in both lightsaber combat and the use of the Force. The Seventh Sister’s role was to track and kill Jedi who survived the purge, particularly focusing on Ahsoka Tano and the crew of the Ghost.
Her backstory is mostly shrouded in mystery, with little detailed information about her life before becoming an Inquisitor. She refuses to talk about it. It’s implied that, like other Inquisitors, she was likely once a Jedi or a Force-sensitive individual who turned to the dark side after being recruited by the Emperor and Darth Vader.
The Seventh Sister is known for her cunning, her agility in combat, and her brutal pursuit of rebels and Jedi. She also seems to derive pleasure from tormenting her enemies, showing a sadistic side when interrogating or fighting her targets. She has a secret sexual side that gets as sadistic as her work.  ]
